ID  - 42965400
TI  - Right Ventricular Dysfunction and Ventriculo-Arterial Uncoupling in Heart Failure With Preserved Ejection Fraction: A Phenotype-Specific Review of Mechanisms, Diagnosis, and Therapeutic Strategies.
AU  - Chamoun Amarelle
AU  - Farooq Talha
AU  - Batool Suhayya
AU  - Tameez-Ud-Din Sadia
AU  - Yousaf Muhammad
AU  - Memon Preet
