TI  - Epicardial adipose tissue as a metabolically active visceral fat depot: an emerging target in cardiovascular disease.
AU  - Rojas-Bergés Isabella
AU  - Villamil-Galván Ricardo Mauricio
AU  - Salgado-López Santiago
AU  - Obregón-Rosas Santiago
AU  - Granados-Montiel Julio
