TI  - Retinal Outcomes in Diabetes: Antihyperglycemic Therapy, EWDR, and Perioperative Considerations.
AU  - Wang Tongyu
AU  - Zeng Jiling
AU  - Tan Mengquan
AU  - Zhong Meiling
AU  - Zhou Huixian
AU  - Dai Yaling
